Each cluster-level Prometheus instance must scrape its own process metrics and the Node Exporter running on its designated port. The global federation instance must not scrape any application targets directly; it must only pull from the /federate endpoints of the two cluster instances. All three instances must be managed as systemd services that restart on failure.

